# 공개 API 계약: README 기존 프로젝트에 적용하기 사용 예 (기능 008 US3, FR-019, SC-002)
# 찾기 결과를 파이프로 일괄 등록에 넘기고 검증한다. 가상 파일 시스템은 라이브러리 함수 호출 사이에 바뀐 상태를 이어 주지 않으므로
# 마지막 검증은 처음 데이터 파일 기준이다(실제 연속 동작은 tests/manual-checks.md 14절).
target readme-example apply-existing-project
layer api
self scripts/apply-paths.sh
fs file /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
fs file /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.sh
fs file /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
content DOCS=docs
fs file /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
content APP_CONFIG=config/app.json
fs file /t/my\sproject/scripts/apply-paths.sh
fs dir /t/my\sproject/docs
fs file /t/my\sproject/config/app.json

case readme-apply-existing-project-registers-new-candidates
fs dir /t/my\sproject/src
fs file /t/my\sproject/assets/logo.png
fs file /t/my\sproject/scripts/build.sh
content ls src docs
content cat config/app.json
content cp assets/logo.png build/out.txt
cwd /t/my\sproject
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 1건, 파일 1건, 유지 0건
out project-path-gateway: 검증 통과 2건
op source ./.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.sh
op copy-preserve /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf DOCS=docs\nSRC=src\n
op move /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op copy-preserve /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf
op write /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf APP_CONFIG=config/app.json\nASSETS_LOGO_PNG=assets/logo.png\n
op move /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/my\sproject/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf

case readme-apply-existing-project-nothing-new
fs file /t/my\sproject/scripts/build.sh
content ls docs
content cat config/app.json
cwd /t/my\sproject
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 0건, 파일 0건, 유지 0건
out project-path-gateway: 검증 통과 2건
op source ./.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.sh
